            "role": "A",
            "text": "上一段讲到「变分自编码器」。现在把镜头转向「扩散模型」，沿着这条故事线换一个问题：把时间拨回2015年，「扩散模型」究竟在解决一个什么样的难题？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "storyline-sequence"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "扩散模型学习逆转逐步加噪过程。早期热力学形式成为后来的去噪扩散概率模型和现代文生图系统的基础。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-deep-unsupervised-learning-using-nonequilibrium-thermodynamics"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "这听起来像一个漂亮的方向。真正让它运转起来的核心机制是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "训练中数据被逐步破坏成噪声，神经网络学习把噪声反向还原为样本的步骤。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-deep-unsupervised-learning-using-nonequilibrium-thermodynamics"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "那它为什么没有停留在一篇论文或一次实验里？后来研究者真正继承了什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "专家通常把扩散模型视为 GAN 和 VAE 之后的主要生成模型家族之一。它的长期影响在于迭代去噪配方支撑了许多高质量图像、音频和视频生成器。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-deep-unsupervised-learning-using-nonequilibrium-thermodynamics"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
